Password Reset
====

A password reset was requested for your email, <%= @user.email %>. If you did not request this password reset, your account is safe. If you did, you can use the button below to reset your password. This link will expire in 24 hours.

<%= url_for controller: "users", action: "password_reset_final", only_path: false, password_reset_token: @token, user_id: @user.id %>

Treat the above link like your password. If someone else obtains this link, they will be able to change your password.